1. **Polyglot Compute Diversity Invariant:**
   $$\max_{i}(s_i) \le 0.15 \implies \text{HHI}_{\text{Kernel/ISA}} = \sum_{i=1}^M s_i^2 \le 0.15 \implies \text{MaxBlastRadius}(\text{CVE}_i) \le 15\%$$

2. **Standoff Custody Overseer Separation Invariant:**
   $$\text{Secrets}(\mathcal{E}_{\text{Worker}}) = \emptyset \;\land\; \text{Ingress}(\mathcal{E}_{\text{Custody}}) = 0 \implies \text{KeyExfiltrationOnWorkerBreach} = 0$$

3. **Passive Scanner Attribution Invariant:**
   $$\frac{\partial (\text{SNR}_{\text{Attribution}})}{\partial R_{\text{ScanPackets}}} > 0 \;\land\; \text{Egress}_{\text{DarkPort}} = 0\text{ bps}$$

4. **$\mathcal{O}(1)$ Edge AST Gate vs Little's Law SIEM Queue Invariant:**
   $$\text{Task} \notin \text{AST}_{\text{Valid}} \implies \text{DropLatency}_{\text{Edge}} = \mathcal{O}(1) \;\land\; L_{\text{SOC}} = \Lambda W_{\text{SOC}} = 0$$

